%% demo.mgp — the gucOS MagicPoint demo deck (todos/0119).
%% Plain-text slides: one %page per slide; %-directives style them.
%deffont "standard" tfont "/usr/share/fonts/mono.ttf"
%default 1 area 90 90, size 2, fore "white", back "MidnightBlue", font "standard"
%default 2 size 9, vgap 20, prefix " ", center
%default 3 size 5, fore "yellow", vgap 30
%tab 1 size 5, vgap 40, prefix "  ", icon box "green" 50, left
%tab 2 size 4, vgap 40, prefix "      ", icon arc "yellow" 50, left
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

MagicPoint

on gucOS, via SDL

%center
%size 3, fore "gray70"
space / click: next   b: back   q: quit
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Plain text decks

	one page per %page
	directives style lines
		size, color, alignment
		bullets via tab depth
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page
%bgrad 100 100 256 1 0 "blue" "black"

Backgrounds

	gradients render inline
	%bgrad blue to black
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Images

%center
%newimage "demo.gif"

%size 3, fore "gray70", center
static GIF decoded via giflib
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Pause

	this line shows first
%pause
	this one after a click
%pause
	and this one last
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

Colors

%size 6
%fore "red", center
red
%fore "green", center
green
%fore "LightSalmon", center
LightSalmon
%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
%page

The end

%size 4, center
write decks in vi, present with mgp
